## Background

Avi identified the priority as translating a high-level idea into specs, rather than adding verification. Existing spec-quality evaluation checks clause shape and item coverage; activation auditing preserves stated requirements. Those mechanisms alone cannot develop missing user scenarios. This implements the approved product-shaping proposal, building inside existing plan bodies and authoring/activation/read surfaces. The prior spec-driven-tooling-integration-2026-10-05 draft remains separate: this is the newly authorized upstream authoring improvement, not activation of its frozen-test work.

